# Claude Code session state (scheduled_tasks.lock, tool outputs).
# Ignore contents by default, but share the SessionStart hook and its wiring
# so every Claude Code on the web session pre-warms the Gradle cache
# (sandbox tool-execution cannot reach dl.google.com — SessionStart can).
# Plans live in docs/plans/ (tracked, in-flight + done/) so cloud sessions can
# execute them — a cloud checkout never sees ~/.claude, and a headless session
# cannot write under .claude/ at all (docs/GOTCHAS.md). The rest of .claude/ is
# harness config: only the hooks, settings and skills below are tracked.
.claude/*
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/session-start.sh
!.claude/hooks/block-heredoc-commit.sh
!.claude/hooks/promote-memory.sh
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/

# Plan runner logs and rendered prompts (scripts/run-plan.sh) — per host, never shared
docs/plans/.runs/

# Kotlin compiler daemon error logs
.kotlin/
